      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s a bold move.\n\nFirst, it appears that sommething isn\u0027t quite right yet with the rewritten TLS filter in 2.2.4. See for instance [1].\n\nSecond, Apache MINA sshd\u0027s sshd-mina bundle was written and tested against Apache MINA 2.0.23 only. I added tests against 2.2.4 only yesterday, and I was _very_ surprised to see them succeed because there is a source incompatibility. I had expected some exception at run-time... See [2], [3], and [4].\n\nIf you want to stay on 2.0.X, go to 2.0.27.\n\n[1] https://lists.apache.org/thread/hxc610y7w5rn6l74ctbrfmxv2kt197p7\n[2] https://github.com/apache/mina-sshd/commit/f826ec945a40329f92b36f64222982f03fef71b6\n[3] https://github.com/apache/mina-sshd/pull/573\n[4] https://github.com/apache/mina/pull/48",
